    "text": "## sub_507079_00507079 — 2x2 pixel quad accumulation buffer with flush\n\n**Summary:** Accumulates vertex/texel data into 2×2 quad buffer slots. On first write to a slot, allocates staging buffer; fills sub-pixel data from source surface via stride-based addressing. When all 4 sub-pixels filled (bits 0-3), flushes the completed 2x2 block via processing callbacks and recycles or frees the slot buffer.\n\n**Frame-path:** NOT_FOUND  \n**Call frequency:** UNKNOWN (static path unknown — called indirectly)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x8 | RW | — | this[2] — format/type selector (checked == 1? or other) |\n| this | 0xC | RW | — | this[3] — Y position accumulator |\n| this | 0x10 | RW | 0 | this[4] — scratch/result storage |\n| this | 0x14 | R | — | this[5] — offset accumulator for coordinate tracking |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- this 0x8: once — set to accumulated position during processing\n- this 0xC: once — updated with offset from v5[1040]\n- this 0x10: once — set to 0; overwritten by processing callbacks\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 005007ec | sub_5007EC | R | element constructor for vector init during buffer allocation |\n| 0059c548 | loc_59C548 | R | SEH jump target or exception handling label |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 005008c2 | sub_5008C2 | vector constructor for staging buffer elements |\n| 00506ce2 | DirectXVertexBufferFormatConversion | converts vertex float format if this[1042] format code is non-zero |\n| 00587bcf | FreeWrapper_7bcf | frees staging buffers on slot flush |\n| 00587c03 | OperatorNewNhMallocWrapper | allocates slot staging buffer (16 × element_count × width) |\n| 0058a5d8 | SEHHandlerInit | initialises structured exception handler |\n\n**Guard condition